,"source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"谷崎 御景","creatorId":"vndb:s3547","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3547","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3547","name":"谷崎 御景","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132142","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"みこ","creatorId":"vndb:s7045","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7045","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7045","name":"みこ","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132143","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"とむ 少佐","creatorId":"vndb:s14207","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14207","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14207","name":"喜多 智一","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132146","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ricono","creatorId":"vndb:s9492","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9492","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9492","name":"ricono","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132149","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"福山 沙織","creatorId":"vndb:s34389","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34389","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34389","name":"福山 沙織","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132151","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"株式会社スタジオクレフ","creatorId":"vndb:s45004","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45004","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45004","name":"Studio CLEF(株式会社スタジオクレフ)","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:132152","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49917","characterName":"御巫 千夜子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49917"},"originalCharacterName":"御巫 千夜子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1001"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 17"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiyako (nickname \"Chako\") is the true identity of the ghost from the cursed Blu-ray disc. She accidentally regains a physical human body as a result of Murasaki’s imperfect exorcism only removing her grudges. Chiyako is such mild-mannered, polite, and downright kind spirit that you wouldn’t even imagine her to be an evil spirit in any way. She has a scar on the right side of her forehead and has lost sight in her right eye, whose color is different from her left one. Shuuichi applies a bandage around her right eye so that she can stop feeling embarrassed about the eye color, after which the bandage becomes her treasure. Her wearing a hospital gown could have something to do with the reason why she turned into an evil ghost… And the reason why there are six other girls stuck inside her body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49917"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/968689935a8dc63b379a8e32e84dc43e0ef99478380707e41cd71669e4aea6b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c2aa2a3d1d5bfd5e71d27026844fffc8b64cf1ac51206578af138792c2eb1d6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"上坂 すみれ","creatorId":"vndb:s4466","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4466","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4466","name":"上坂 すみれ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70059","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"鈴代 紗弓","creatorId":"vndb:s20232","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20232","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20232","name":"鈴代 紗弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70068","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49918","characterName":"忽那 サクラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49918"},"originalCharacterName":"忽那 サクラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 7"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakura is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the first victim of the \"Spirited Away\" incident. She was born and raised in a farm village family. Her infinite patience makes her the most dependable of the seven girls. When alive, she could not eat as much as she wanted, because her family was large yet poor, and she would have to restrain her appetite to feed her younger siblings. Hence, food in her range sometimes vanishes into thin air instantly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49918"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/6130cab85fd0fd542564f462bf6bb8210046241f7f0e2b8216d1ee393792a3e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a90bce27de0c62690d9dc355c45b4db140aa0eaa894bb3e7c3f88846354d6e22.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐谷 蝶々","creatorId":"vndb:s12015","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12015","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12015","name":"桐谷 蝶々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70063","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49919","characterName":"月野木 コトハ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49919"},"originalCharacterName":"月野木 コトハ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"305"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 9"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kotoha is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the fifth victim of the Spirited Away incident. Born and raised in a rich family, she is slightly self-centered yet gentle at heart, terrified of being alone, and a bit of a jealous type. She finds it difficult to wear her heart on her sleeve and tends to be harsh toward others. Her emotions fluctuate easily due to her anxieties, but deep down she seeks kindness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49919"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32defe18bb460942ee784fa71047f204aa08d666082e6075a3a4ce3399e349de.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a4e146558c75e53203e7cb9df2ebcaeb3f2f631387458f5dce2fd209a606711.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤 英美里","creatorId":"vndb:s1190","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1190","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1190","name":"加藤 英美里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70057","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"荒浪 和沙","creatorId":"vndb:s3662","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3662","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3662","name":"荒浪 和沙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70058","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49920","characterName":"色摩 ネネ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49920"},"originalCharacterName":"色摩 ネネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"422"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 10"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nene is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the fourth victim of the Spirited Away incident. She has considerable interest in the sexual passion between men and women because of her mother, and herself being force-ripe. Without any romantic experiences throughout her lifetime, she demands some with Shuuichi so daringly as to embarrass Chiyako."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49920"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d29d7de169a33f9001c2f765b6782e5c2ca5d9647727b81e20a1f64900f3e03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e98ec472fa2ad024cc002c682de5538633ea4593b323b8d3952c15a10adb1ff.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水 愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70055","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"村上 奈津実","creatorId":"vndb:s18794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18794","name":"村上 奈津実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70067","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49921","characterName":"小鳥遊 マリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49921"},"originalCharacterName":"小鳥遊 マリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"702"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 8"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mari is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the second victim of the Spirited Away incident. She overflows with energy, laughs a lot, and has a habit of saying “Crazy!”. She just can’t stop jumping and milling around. Everyone sees her as a freewheeling noisemaker, but they love her despite those qualities. On the other hand, she can't interact well with Shuuichi’s mother due to some bad memories of her own mother. She considers herself a boy for a very specific reason."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49921"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36a198ffc935ad4a45f62507f5bf41af6a5a6bddb4fb1fa657ad8f6dbaef165f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/6938edf4cf3fa82e580497979d8c14339f3699a75095b366bb2f6ffbe37a9dd6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田 昌代","creatorId":"vndb:s14571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14571","name":"藤田昌代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70065","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49922","characterName":"九十九 シズク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49922"},"originalCharacterName":"九十九 シズク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1117"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 8"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuku is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the sixth victim of the Spirited Away incident. Behind her spaced-out, expressionless face is the brain of a genius with incredible comprehension and concentration. She is tight-lipped and a slow talker, but sometimes hits the nail right on the head. Her thirst for knowledge is so strong that once she is focused on something, she will not budge an inch. Though only vaguely, she seems to remember something about the Spirited Away incident that brought death to the seven girls including herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49922"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46044196a51dab5a965b01115d380b1a401c0035404b8b41702e2fa759cf9d65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/1468ae6f7c6fa6a4d24c7b2ec3395ff17faa229a7b7e6e73d0ce6cdc848e86e9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"戸田 めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s3692","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3692","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3692","name":"戸田 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70060","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"桑原 由気","creatorId":"vndb:s14653","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14653","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14653","name":"桑原 由気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70066","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49923","characterName":"百目鬼 イチル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49923"},"originalCharacterName":"百目鬼 イチル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age at Death: 8"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ichiru (nickname: \"Icchan\") is one of the ghost girls who possessed Chiyako, and the third victim of the Spirited Away incident. She hates to lose, talks rough, and completely looks like a delinquent student. She may act rough, but is very considerate and selfless at heart. She is quite attracted to mischief and demands cigarettes, but instead holds a candy cigarette because no one can buy her real ones and Chiyako does not think well of them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49923"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4ced2962b4b22ee476690dfc47c21542696b7a846bb05dc355574ab5bb21dc55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/403dc49893a507abb0e8fb8c73e64b03ca8c641aa90c8af75b248ee4e4f391ca.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水 彩香","creatorId":"vndb:s11941","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11941","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11941","name":"清水 彩香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70061","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49924","characterName":"西蓮寺 紫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49924"},"originalCharacterName":"西蓮寺 紫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"603"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Murasaki is Shuiichi’s childhood friend. A third year in high school. Alive. She gives you the impression of a quiet and expressionless girl, but she is always concerned about Shuuichi. Born and raised in a family with a long history of running a Buddhist temple, she is deeply familiar with the occult, which may be a reason for her to suddenly come out with startling remarks. As a child, she horrified Shuuichi when she was talking alone in his bathroom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49924"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15f185b4bdc38ebcf287a8d67aee56567aaebb494edfeaa22d83560b50d17786.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd253a739c1ad6fa7445076f0425df78668094e4530bc9de93946b38eae1a5aa.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大橋 歩夕","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70056","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49925","characterName":"神崎 みつき","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49925"},"originalCharacterName":"神崎 みつき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"909"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mitsuki is Shuiichi’s mother. A nurse. She is a woman of mettle who has brought Shuiichi up on her own and is loved by everyone. She catches on quick but sometimes rushes to conclusions with weird results. She loves her deceased husband very much even now."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49925"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86a68e9710f66ee864dade2caa22f8d060393133ba50ace9dafc15e3c966fa0b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20cd81dec76b972458fadc7cacfd67b5db33969f2b3e5bb4766bd43f8868baea.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"丸山 美紀","creatorId":"vndb:s12014","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12014","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12014","name":"丸山 美紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70062","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63832","characterName":"紀伊国屋 将","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63832"},"originalCharacterName":"紀伊国屋 将","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1013"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru is a friend of Shuiichi’s and a bad influence. He's a weirdo who talks like an idiot but cherishes his friendships. Information is his expertise and that occasionally helps Shuuichi out."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His shirt says \"Fresh out of Maintenance\". What's that about?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63832"}],"profileFacts"